Journey wait-until → email pairing (Running journeys only)

Pattern from _JourneyActivity on a live journey:
- WAITUNTILSPECIFICDATE-N  →  ActivityName = human date/time text (e.g. September 18, 2026 12:01 AM)
- EMAILV2-N              →  ActivityName = email name (e.g. ASC BC)
- Match N via ActivityExternalKey suffix (WAITUNTILSPECIFICDATE-1 pairs with EMAILV2-1)

Run in Query Studio:
  query-email-send-calendar-journey-wait-until.sql

Ignore WAITBYDURATION / WAITBYDURATION-N (ActivityName is duration text, not a calendar date).

If TRY_CONVERT on ActivityName fails for some rows, check locale/style; raw waitDateText is still in the query output columns on the DE version.
